IT:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Yaawn...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Era così buio stamattina che mi
sono riappisolato, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Morning, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. I must be
psychic or something.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I totally thought it would rain today,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Buenos días, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. Debo de
ser adivino o algo así.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ya sabía que iba a llover hoy,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin ein richtiger Wahrsager!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich wusste schon, dass es heute
regnen würde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Eh, buenos días{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¿Sabes por qué me gusta esta
mañana? ¡Porque llueve!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Et cette pluie qui ne s'arrête pas...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} est quand même plus
belle au soleil,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Non la smette più di piovere.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Uffa, quando {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
c'è il sole ci si diverte
molto di più,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Yağmur bir türlü kesilmiyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
güneşliyken çok daha
eğlenceli,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
Sag mal,{{TAG:0007:0000:0E000000}} ist es Tag oder Nacht?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Wenn es so schüttet, sieht das
irgendwie gleich aus,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It was a dark and stormy night.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}And it's still a dark and stormy
night.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} What a bummer.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Era una notte buia e tempestosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ed è ancora una notte buia e
tempestosa.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Che barba!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Das war ja eine verregnete Nacht!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Nein, das ist IMMER NOCH eine
verregnete Nacht,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Karanlık ve fırtınalı bir geceydi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ve hâlâ karanlık, fırtınalı
bir gece.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Of ya.

ES:
¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Muy buenas, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Te veo ojos como de dormid{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Es que te acabas de levantar?
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Si es así, ¡despierta! Que hay que
disfrutar un poco de esta lluvia
tan chachi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hallo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Warum guckst du so finster?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Gefällt dir der Regen etwa nicht?
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Schade. Ich wollte eigentlich mit
dir Pfützenhüpfen spielen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Huhu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Was machst du so spät noch hier?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hast du den Wetterbericht gelesen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hoffentlich scheint morgen wieder
die Sonne,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I guess you like wandering around in
the middle of the night too, huh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Alors comme ça, toi aussi tu aimes
te promener tard la nuit,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}E così anche a te piace andartene a
zonzo nel cuore della notte, eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Heya, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The only good thing about rain is
that you can skip a shower that day.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lo mejor de la lluvia es que en
esos días no tengo que ducharme.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Dis, tu crois pas que ce serait super
s'il pleuvait {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000E:0000}}
plutôt que de l'eau,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Yağmurlu günlere bayılıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
yerken nasıl mutlu oluyorsam öyle mutlu
ediyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}So the sun is taking the day off,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That's cool. Chilling is important.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Actually, it's probably the most
important thing in the world.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Demek güneş bugün izinli,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İyiymiş. Dinlenmek önemli.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hatta galiba dünyadaki en önemli şey.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}En los días de lluvia siempre me
apetece sentarme a tomar {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wenn es schüttet, kriege ich immer
Appetit auf {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
